,335.96],["professors.",335.96,336.46],["But",337.14,337.52],["this",337.52,337.82],["week,",337.82,338.18]]},{"start":338.58,"end":345.5,"text":"they're holding a series of open lectures for visitors. Most visitors love its cobblestone","words":[["they're",338.58,338.82],["holding",338.82,339.18],["a",339.18,339.4],["series",339.4,339.68],["of",339.68,339.98],["open",339.98,340.46],["lectures",340.46,341.02],["for",341.02,341.44],["visitors.",341.44,341.86],["Most",343.02,343.36],["visitors",343.36,343.82],["love",343.82,344.44],["its",344.44,344.84],["cobblestone",344.84,345.5]]},{"start":345.5,"end":354.14,"text":"streets, lined with old houses. The area is also a wealthy shopper's paradise, with","words":[["streets,",345.5,346.18],["lined",346.52,347.02],["with",347.02,347.28],["old",347.28,347.62],["houses.",347.62,348.18],["The",349.32,349.82],["area",349.82,350.26],["is",350.26,350.6],["also",350.6,351.16],["a",351.16,351.62],["wealthy",351.62,352.02],["shopper's",352.02,352.86],["paradise,",352.86,353.42],["with",353.78,354.14]]},{"start":354.14,"end":359.12,"text":"lots of upscale stores. Don't expect discounts here.","words":[["lots",354.14,354.5],["of",354.5,354.94],["upscale",354.94,355.6],["stores.",355.6,356.3],["Don't",357.04,357.42],["expect",357.42,357.82],["discounts",357.82,358.66],["here.",358.66,359.12]]},{"start":360.84,"end":368.1,"text":"While in that neighborhood, the 18th Century Canal offers a place to relax from the sounds","words":[["While",360.84,361.34],["in",361.34,361.68],["that",361.68,361.96],["neighborhood,",361.96,362.46],["the",363.04,363.16],["18th",363.16,364.26],["Century",364.26,364.26],["Canal",364.26,364.72],["offers",364.72,365.66],["a",365.66,365.94],["place",365.94,366.2],["to",366.2,366.48],["relax",366.48,367.02],["from",367.02,367.4],["the",367.4,367.56],["sounds",367.56,368.1]]},{"start":368.1,"end":375.14,"text":"of hectic city life. You can simply stroll along the canal path or watch local fishermen.","words":[["of",368.1,368.4],["hectic",368.4,368.88],["city",368.88,369.26],["life.",369.26,369.66],["You",370.46,370.74],["can",370.74,370.96],["simply",370.96,371.44],["stroll",371.44,371.82],["along",371.82,372.28],["the",372.28,372.5],["canal",372.5,372.82],["path",372.82,373.18],["or",373.18,373.86],["watch",373.86,374.26],["local",374.26,374.66],["fishermen.",374.66,375.14]]},{"start":376.06,"end":383.26,"text":"Lots of tourists take a packed lunch along and eat it sitting on the grass. I should","words":[["Lots",376.06,376.38],["of",376.38,376.62],["tourists",376.62,377.06],["take",377.06,377.8],["a",377.8,378.08],["packed",378.08,378.56],["lunch",378.56,378.92],["along",378.92,379.3],["and",379.3,379.86],["eat",379.86,380.12],["it",380.12,380.34],["sitting",380.34,380.68],["on",380.68,380.96],["the",380.96,381.1],["grass.",381.1,381.44],["I",382.22,382.94],["should",382.94,383.26]]},{"start":383.26,"end":390.86,"text":"mentioned that the Park Service no longer offers guided canal boat rides, but you can","words":[["mentioned",383.26,383.62],["that",383.62,384.12],["the",384.12,384.56],["Park",384.56,384.88],["Service",384.88,385.4],["no",385.4,386.06],["longer",386.06,386.54],["offers",386.54,387.18],["guided",387.18,387.76],["canal",387.76,388.24],["boat",388.24,388.64],["rides,",388.64,389.22],["but",389.84,390.2],["you",390.2,390.58],["can",390.58,390.86]]},{"start":390.86,"end":397.6,"text":"explore the region's bike trails that go alongside the canal. Please note, though, that","words":[["explore",390.86,391.4],["the",391.4,391.64],["region's",391.64,392.22],["bike",392.22,392.5],["trails",392.5,393.06],["that",393.06,393.36],["go",393.36,393.54],["alongside",393.54,394.16],["the",394.16,394.6],["canal.",394.6,394.98],["Please",395.76,396.28],["note,",396.28,396.64],["though,",396.78,396.94],["that",397.34,397.6]]},{"start":397.6,"end":401.28,"text":"the bike rental places are located in town.","words":[["the",397.6,397.82],["bike",397.82,398.18],["rental",398.18,398.54],["places",398.54,399.06],["are",399.06,399.74],["located",399.74,400.28],["in",400.28,400.78],["town.",400.78,401.28]]},{"start":402.66,"end":409.5,"text":"Well, that's about it. I really encourage you to visit at least a few of these sites.","words":[["Well,",402.66,403.46],["that's",404.02,404.38],["about",404.38,404.66],["it.",404.66,404.86],["I",405.42,405.68],["really",405.68,406.02],["encourage",406.02,406.58],["you",406.58,407.04],["to",407.04,407.28],["visit",407.28,407.62],["at",407.62,407.9],["least",407.9,408.08],["a",408.08,408.34],["few",408.34,408.6],["of",408.6,408.82],["these",408.82,409.06],["sites.",409.06,409.5]]},{"start":409.5,"end":417.02,"text":"sites. As usual, in any big city at night, it's best to move about with a friend or in a group.","words":[["sites.",409.5,409.62],["As",410.24,410.48],["usual,",410.48,410.92],["in",411.32,411.56],["any",411.56,411.88],["big",411.88,412.1],["city",412.1,412.46],["at",412.46,412.8],["night,",412.8,413.18],["it's",413.66,413.9],["best",413.9,414.18],["to",414.18,414.48],["move",414.48,414.68],["about",414.68,415.08],["with",415.08,415.38],["a",415.38,415.5],["friend",415.5,415.92],["or",415.92,416.46],["in",416.46,416.64],["a",416.64,416.78],["group.",416.78,417.02]]},{"start":418.0,"end":426.26,"text":"Some sites are too far to walk, so some people use public buses. But it is better to take","words":[["Some",418.0,418.54],["sites",418.54,419.0],["are",419.0,419.4],["too",419.4,419.76],["far",419.76,420.12],["to",420.12,420.26],["walk,",420.26,420.68],["so",421.26,421.52],["some",421.52,421.84],["people",421.84,422.22],["use",422.22,422.86],["public",422.86,423.36],["buses.",423.36,423.9],["But",424.62,425.12],["it",425.12,425.26],["is",425.26,425.44],["better",425.44,425.76],["to",425.76,426.0],["take",426.0,426.26]]},{"start":426.26,"end":433.8,"text":"a cab or a hotel shuttle bus. This might sound odd, but be sure to carry some water","words":[["a",426.26,426.52],["cab",426.52,426.82],["or",426.